# Word→long extension via array indexing (extsw/extuw path).
# Positive: the index add targets the data symbol and the element load
# uses the far-deref pattern (lda.l $0000,x — always reads bank $00,
# which is why the const array must stay in bank $00 / SUPERFREE).
in get_element: present adc\.w #data
in get_element: present lda\.l \$0000,x
section data: present SUPERFREE
# Negative: no codegen hole marker anywhere in the output.
absent ; unhandled op
